; os32-gcc16 qualification: Execute run-tests from the folder holding bin/.
; Writes results/<test>.txt and results/summary.txt (each test's return code).
; t11-t19 test C++ thread safety. t3 (all the thread pieces together) crashed
; on 11 Oct with the stock libpthread; t18 ended the shell running it (11 Oct),
; so it runs last of all.
FailAt 1000
Stack 1000000
If NOT EXISTS results
  MakeDir results
EndIf
Echo "os32-gcc16 tests" >results/summary.txt
Date >>results/summary.txt
